    "procedure": [
      "Build book source order and strata before filtering. Bovary pool is batch 2; Sapiens pool is the full book.",
      "Remove first open-coding, DIAG-001, known upstream exclusions and Bovary batch 3 by source identity plus unit ID.",
      "Initialize random.Random(20261115) once. In book order bovary,sapiens and stratum order 1,2,3, shuffle each remaining source-ordered candidate list once.",
